  "source_id": "raw_html_bf9fba1795b5eb0e",
  "source_identity": {
    "canonical_url": "https://www.whattoexpect.com/first-year/postpartum-health-and-care/bloodshot-eyes-postpartum/",
    "source_record_id": "raw_html_bf9fba1795b5eb0e",
    "udare_article_path": "C:\\Users\\HP\\Documents\\LinkCraftor\\backend\\server\\data\\udare_store\\ws_whattoexpect_com\\articles\\first-year-postpartum-health-and-care-bloodshot-eyes-postpartum_bf9fba17.html",
    "udare_article_sha256": "e3dddf782d8997f78a87adcb05db72ce509b2e051a4b7ae9f3870fadc6e18a72"
  },
  "source_name": "https://www.whattoexpect.com/first-year/postpartum-health-and-care/bloodshot-eyes-postpartum/",
  "source_type": "website",
  "structure": {
    "block_count": 17,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Why Are My Eyes Bloodshot After Giving Birth?",
        "text_sha256": "45a3957466d62b44fd01226efd11b42ce033c702412fec85529b4075c7b3081d",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "bloodshot eyes postpartum, woman using eye drops",
        "text_sha256": "cfc665e314d31ec0b99932c61d474e60b0f1b0ea06941fef881d9b4a08d7efbf",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You've had bloodshot eyes before — but never like this. Here's why your eyes may be bloodshot postpartum, how long it will last and what you can do about it.",
        "text_sha256": "adc3b875c57f6f46e135669e37d424ef32367aa5013396578127762e8bcc455e",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Burst blood vessels underneath and inside your eyes after you give birth can make you look like you've gone 10 rounds in the ring. And you have!",
        "text_sha256": "1f12e76c6d781d6e18b4517b037589a8b49e94f3c929dc00e0a078b4bead0c76",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But take heart in knowing that many women have bloodshot eyes postpartum, and this symptom is very temporary.",
        "text_sha256": "e8e6d88ae40590ddc55bb8212c7a2722cce6fcff895b499f0d0cb5067f38fdfc",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What causes bloodshot eyes postpartum?",
        "text_sha256": "7ad2bf49994f6bc008ff25b9f9888dc3c4b3b1a87918a8bb9d5bec7daf134846",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Bloodshot eyes after giving birth are caused by the tiny capillaries, or blood vessels, in your eyes bursting while you pushed during labor and delivery.",
        "text_sha256": "c3b76c09bea0c5fea0894a23263886d82d9fce40f629325a6bed4293fcf48b99",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "How long do bloodshot eyes postpartum last?",
        "text_sha256": "d16f00b766c2b9c7d782b7f38c4f231ae1c23a82e99d0f67b0a282265ca49938",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Yes, your eyes look a tad scary now — but they'll start to heal right away and should clear up completely in a week or two. Remember, your baby thinks you're gorgeous, no matter what!",
        "text_sha256": "d089de51a1927d9378d6e0bc57daa6e3d1c841090f74bcc6ed3cd7fb16a6ef87",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What can you do about bloodshot eyes postpartum?",
        "text_sha256": "867b3ca4fa8a7a722664b3bd4ea032a4972f1c1f5bac25ae4fcea33580a88208",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Your bloodshot eyes will get better on their own, so no medical treatment is necessary and you shouldn't use over-the-counter eye drops to reduce the redness.",
        "text_sha256": "430e4c0f359d4265ee55e0c89afd45c62138ba2f939c4c95d0f2db5d4200e531",
        "word_count": 26
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But there are some things you can do about your bloodshot eyes while you're waiting for them to clear up:",
        "text_sha256": "e9e6c084f1c08103d99d4d691b8643ebf347455b654abf8401b97fecfcd96ede",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Apply cold compresses several times a day for 10 minutes at a time to help speed recovery.",
        "text_sha256": "ab1e1c3e7e0bcaaeab272dd9bca3f107aec62c351ed9379d2b3b4b0eec85a4db",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "If you feel self-conscious in public, channel your inner paparazzi-dodging celeb and sport a pair of glam sunglasses.",
        "text_sha256": "af7254350f971b6d232d5e1a6c64ec9cc9709813fe418d9ba46909bed3e80b88",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "When to call the doctor about bloodshot eyes postpartum",
        "text_sha256": "35868d9bcd4765bbfd0f617ccdea7f9bbebb26524cb8c7c028a1d7d0a6761adb",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If your bloodshot eyes don't clear up in a couple of weeks or you're bruising or have burst capillaries on other parts of your body, call your doctor to be sure it's not a sign of something more serious.",
        "text_sha256": "bf159039692b6507acaf7a7f4a105446d00e6f6d4c3235fe57c6ee9316e063fb",
        "word_count": 39
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "But rest assured that bloodshot eyes are a very common, and very temporary, postpartum symptom — and another reminder of what a trooper you were in the delivery room!",
        "text_sha256": "22ff9c73a9c8f8596e10c0e4895684ede77c4a97dcb66d2171f3781a935d2ca9",
        "word_count": 29
      }
    ],
    "content_word_count": 328,
    "heading_count": 5
  },
  "title": "Bloodshot Eyes Postpartum",
